      "body": "## Status: pending adversarial review \u2014 do not merge, do not publish\n\nWS7 engine and widgets packages (`@zodiacs/engine@0.1.0`, `@zodiacs/widgets@0.1.0`), pushed for review bookkeeping. The site consumes the engine only as the audited vendored tarball in `ZodiacsOfficial/site` (`vendor/zodiacs-engine-0.1.0.tgz`, SHA-256 pinned) \u2014 **no site deploy depends on this repository**.\n\nReview state (Fable):\n- Vendored artifact audited byte-for-byte at the site gate: MIT, single dependency `astronomy-engine` ^2.1.19 (imported, not bundled), zero Swiss Ephemeris markers, NOTICE carries astronomy-engine MIT + GeoNames CC BY 4.0 with a downstream retention instruction.\n- Source-level spot-check on this branch: swisseph appears only in LICENSING.md/README prose describing its deliberate exclusion; accuracy fixtures cite public JPL Horizons vectors with query parameters documented in the test source.\n- Remaining before any npm publish: full adversarial pass over the package source and its 146-test suite, and the operator's publication authority per LICENSING.md.\n\n\ud83e\udd16 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01X4bUR6JawKqA1Qd6DWbm8t\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01X4bUR6JawKqA1Qd6DWbm8t)_",
