    {
      "baseRefName": "codex/platform-geonames-retry",
      "baseRefOid": "4f8903415e95a60969e84f7eb91e72f2f61ad315",
      "body": "Fresh natal exports need to preserve the requested house system when calculation falls back, retain explicit time-resolution assumptions, and reject unsafe imports without exposing birth data in diagnostics. This adds the optional `@zodiacs/engine/receipt` draft codec, with bounded JSON import, full-precision results, requested/actual houses, captured source instant/local context, and fixed-field redaction.\n\nStacked on #7. Runtime source: `aaade67d0d49e8b10d1bc5c59cf345d6106dc270`; artifact/evidence commit: `2000377b1b537c1b08c873889059acc8edacc4fe`. The site and public starter remain on immutable rc.1; account sync/storage v1 and the optional read-only ownership SDK are unchanged. This Zodiacs draft does not complete all account compatibility or C02 integration work.\n\nValidation: 429 tests / 29 files on Node 20 and 22; required workspace lint/types/format/checksum/build/export/pack/contents/neutrality and TypeDoc gates; actual clean packed consumers on both runtimes with TypeScript 5.9.3, core/privacy/GeoNames/receipt checks; zero advisories in the isolated consumer. Ninety-six synthetic chart cases exactly match rc.1 numerical output. Separate tool-backed adversarial review plus integrator reruns covered 60 codec controls, 21,500 JSON differential cases, and fixed pole/duplicate-key counterexamples. Initial failures and their corrections are retained. These are finite internal checks, not human expert certification or broad astronomical/historical accuracy.\n\n- [Draft schema reference and fixtures](https://github.com/ZodiacsOfficial/sdk/blob/2000377b1b537c1b08c873889059acc8edacc4fe/docs/platform/receipt-draft-v1.md)\n- [Commands, logs, limits and provenance](https://github.com/ZodiacsOfficial/sdk/blob/2000377b1b537c1b08c873889059acc8edacc4fe/docs/platform/EVIDENCE.md)\n- [Frozen engine 0.1.1-rc.3 artifact](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ZodiacsOfficial/sdk/2000377b1b537c1b08c873889059acc8edacc4fe/artifacts/zodiacs-engine-0.1.1-rc.3.tgz), SHA-256 `aeab68793129517abe7498c5f5a17197d387eed7cbdaa9614f3b8cd939b11a17` (32,079 bytes).\n\nImported provenance remains a claim; matching labels do not authenticate or guarantee cross-version replay. Same-realm proxy inspection is not a sandbox. Exact poles and degenerate angle coverage, account downgrade safety, and wider numerical review remain explicit limits.\n\n**Do not merge or publish.** The explicit #5 hold and operator publication authority remain unresolved. Stacked PRs do not trigger the repository's main-targeting CI; no successful stacked CI or production deployment is claimed. No npm publication, production change, account operation, outreach, spending, or external adoption occurred. Roll back this additive candidate by removing its optional integration or selecting the previous immutable artifact; never replace an existing version's bytes.\n",
